<title>UK: GOLF-WORLD MATCHPLAY SEMIFINAL POSITIONS.</title>
<headline>GOLF-WORLD MATCHPLAY SEMIFINAL POSITIONS.</headline>
<dateline>WENTWORTH, England 1996-10-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Postions after 18</p>
<p>holes in the semifinals of the World Matchplay championship on</p>
<p>Saturday (seedings in brackets):</p>
<p>1-Ernie Els (South Africa) leads 4-Mark Brooks (U.S.) by six</p>
<p>holes.</p>
<p>Vijay Singh (Fiji) level with 2-Tom Lehman (U.S.)</p>
</text>
